      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "With Pioneer Day just around the corner, what better time than now to dive into the rich history of our city?",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.westjordan.utah.gov/newsroom/2024/07/celebrating-the-pioneers-of-west-jordan/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1863, the discovery of ore in the Oquirrh Mountains further spurred the area’s growth, aligning with the completion of the transcontinental railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.westjordan.utah.gov/newsroom/2024/07/celebrating-the-pioneers-of-west-jordan/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Discover the Gale Center of History & Culture – Best for History Buffs Step back in time at this interactive museum that brings West Jordan’s past to life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://travelblaze.net/12-best-things-to-do-in-west-jordan-utah-the-ultimate-locals-guide/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Don’t leave without checking out the original Bingham Stagecoach – it’s survived more than 150 years of Utah history!",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://travelblaze.net/12-best-things-to-do-in-west-jordan-utah-the-ultimate-locals-guide/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Like its Middle Eastern namesake, the Jordan River flows from a fresh water lake (Utah Lake) to an inland salt sea (Great Salt Lake).",
